flowchart TB
    Device["Thiết bị theo dõi"] -->|Rawdata / status / events / firmware| EMQX["EMQX (broker MQTT)"]
    EMQX -->|Device topics| Bridge["MQTT Bridge"]
    Bridge --> VictoriaMetricsNode["VictoriaMetrics"]
    Bridge --> VictoriaLogsNode["VictoriaLogs"]
    Bridge --> PostgreSQLNode["PostgreSQL"]
    Bridge --> Internal["internal/events/#"]
    Internal -->|Subscribe| API["Backend API + realtime listener"]
    Dashboard["Giao diện web"] -->|REST request| API
    API --> Socket["Socket.IO /ws"]
    Socket --> Dashboard["Giao diện web"]
    API -->|Commands / OTA| EMQX
    EMQX -->|Topic commands| Device

